# The hub reads everything and writes downlinks.
user hub
topic readwrite alarm/v1/#

# DEV ONLY: simulates an attacker who sniffed broker credentials off the
# Wi-Fi (MQTT is plain TCP). Remove this block on a real deployment.
user attacker
topic readwrite alarm/v1/#

# Each node: write its own uplink and status, read its own downlink.
pattern write alarm/v1/%u/up
pattern write alarm/v1/%u/status
pattern read alarm/v1/%u/down
